            "block_content": "There remain a few grandfathered side payment Employees in Misc. Departments other than those identified above (Men's and Women Shoes not included) which will be paid a new commission rate and Quarterly bonus on the same calculation noted above. If Dual commission as per Men's Clothing; if single commission as per the calculator method of Furniture. New Commission rates will be rounded to the nearest 25%. The Company will submit a list of these Employees and their new draw commission structure to the Union.",
